  "deliverables": [
    "新增run-bound output-bit driver contract artifact：逐bit绑定family/index/raw/opensta object/net/unique driver cell-type-pin/stdlib function/class/value及synth-design/netlist-manifest/whitelist/stdlib/run identity hashes；只允许DYNAMIC、CONSTANT_0、CONSTANT_1且三类互斥完整。A7 AddSub必须得到d-fflags dynamic={0,1,2,4}, constant0={3}，共享d/s net204一致。",
    "升级child timing inventory与Python schema/parser：dynamic bit立即物化PathEnd delay/slack/start/end，constant bit必须零Q路径且delay/slack N/A；max/min分类一致。输入setup/hold合同不回归，family摘要只从dynamic bits派生，全constant family显式支持。",
    "升级canonical Liberty与validator：vector output逐bitpin，dynamic member仅rising_edge timing，constant member仅function 0/1且无普通timing；绑定完整bit inventory digest。runner在OpenSTA前生成并绑定driver contract，child result/composite manifest/summary receipts包含该artifact；top known-macro读取不得伪造constant timing，必要时只做最小top兼容改动。",
    "定向门禁使用A7完整synth-design真实正例和一个DFF+TIE mixed-output真实OpenSTA harness；拒绝无路径动态伪constant、function反转、stdlib/whitelist/netlist重放、零/多driver、组合driver冒充constant、constant出现Q路径、dynamic无路径、缺/重bit、max-min分类漂移、constant同时含function与timing、top删功能覆盖。Registry单一入口和spec明确diagnostic范围，不要求formal/equivalence signoff。"
